      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_158"
      ],
      "explanation": "In \\((x^2-y^2)/(x+y)\\), the factor \\(x+y\\) can be canceled; in \\(2x/(4y)\\), the factor 2 can be canceled; and \\((x-y)/(y-x)=-1\\) can be reduced. However, \\(x+y\\) and \\(x^2+y^2\\) have no common factor, so \\((x+y)/(x^2+y^2)\\) is in lowest terms.",
